	MalterlibPosixInitFileName `@(MalterlibCompiledFilesSourceBase)/@(Workspace:Workspace.Name)/Intermediate/Lib_Malterlib_Init/@(Platform)/@(Architecture)/@(FullConfiguration)/@(MalterlibXcodeObjectsDirectory)/@(MalterlibXcodeBuildArchitecture)/Malterlib_Core_PlatformImp_Posix_Init.o`
